@name     stack_over
@alias    over
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_stack_over_2
@type     immediate
@arity    2
@match    (any, any)
@summary  duplicate second stack argument to top
@doc
Copies second argument to top of parser stack.
Usage: 1 2 over
@code
    return skode_exec_over(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end

